#: src/Abilities/AbilityCatalog.php:311
msgid ""
"Send a synchronous test delivery for a webhook using a provided or captured "
"payload, and return the HTTP result so the agent can verify the integration "
"end to end. This makes a REAL delivery now, so for an internal REST "
"endpoint it can actually create or modify data (e.g. create a WordPress "
"user); it requires confirmation. It sends the REAL mapped-and-glued "
"payload, so any non-2xx response means the build does not work and the run "
"STOPS there — the result (status + the endpoint's response body) comes back "
"to you, so fix the mapping or the pre-dispatch snippet from that response "
"and re-test. Order every plan so test_dispatch comes before enable_webhook, "
"and never treat a step as done just because you proposed it."
msgstr ""
"使用提供的或已捕获的载荷为 Webhook 发送一次同步测试投递，并返回 HTTP "
"结果，以便智能体端到端验证集成。这是一次立即执行的真实投递，因此对内部 REST 端点它可能真的创建或修改数据（例如创建一个 WordPress "
"用户）；需要确认。它发送的是真实的映射并经 glue 处理后的载荷，所以任何非 2xx 响应都意味着构建不可用，运行会在此停止——结果（状态码 + "
"端点的响应体）会返回给你，请根据该响应修复映射或预发送代码片段并重新测试。安排每个计划时让 test_dispatch 在 "
"enable_webhook 之前，并且绝不要因为提出了某个步骤就把它当作已完成。"

