#: src/Abilities/AbilityCatalog.php:170
msgid ""
"Set the payload field mapping for a webhook+trigger. field_mapping MUST be "
"an object {\"mappings\":[{\"source\":\"<dot.path in the captured "
"payload>\",\"target\":\"<dot.path in the outgoing "
"body>\",\"cast\":\"number|string|boolean|stringify\" "
"(optional)}],\"excluded\":[\"<dot.path to "
"drop>\"],\"includeUnmapped\":true|false}. It can only move/rename/exclude "
"EXISTING payload fields — static or constant values are NOT supported "
"(inject those with a pre-dispatch Code Glue snippet instead). The mapping "
"runs BEFORE any pre-dispatch snippet, so snippet output cannot be mapped — "
"and, in the other direction, the snippet only ever sees what the mapping "
"LEFT BEHIND. With includeUnmapped:false everything unmapped is deleted, "
"including \"args\", so a snippet reading $args[0] gets nothing: whenever a "
"snippet needs a source field, map it through explicitly (e.g. source "
"\"args.0\" → target \"post_id\") and have the snippet unset it before "
"returning if it must not be sent. Run get_trigger_schema first and take "
"source paths from the real captured payload."
msgstr ""
"为 Webhook+触发器设置载荷字段映射。field_mapping 必须是一个对象 "
"{\"mappings\":[{\"source\":\"<捕获载荷中的点分路径>\",\"target\":\"<出站请求体中的点分路径>\",\""
"cast\":\"number|string|boolean|stringify\"（可选）}],\"excluded\":[\"<要丢弃的点分路径>\""
"],\"includeUnmapped\":true|false}。它只能移动/重命名/排除已存在的载荷字段——不支持静态或常量值（请用预发送 "
"Code Glue "
"代码片段注入）。映射在任何预发送代码片段之前运行，所以代码片段的输出无法被映射——反过来，代码片段只能看到映射留下的内容。includeUnmapped"
":false 时所有未映射的内容都会被删除，包括 \"args\"，因此读取 $args[0] "
"的代码片段什么也拿不到：当代码片段需要某个源字段时，请显式映射它（例如 source \"args.0\" → target "
"\"post_id\"），若不应发送则让代码片段在返回前 unset 它。先运行 get_trigger_schema，并从真实捕获的载荷中获取源路径。"

